@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
title Screen Outcome and Safe Recovery - Conceptual Model
state "Ready / permitted task context" as ready
state "Request pending" as pending
state "Invalid input" as invalid
state "Denied / expired / hidden" as denied
state "Conflict - current version review" as conflict
state "Known incomplete work" as incomplete
state "Unknown consequential outcome" as unknown
state "Confirmed recorded outcome" as confirmed
state "Safe unavailable / failed outcome" as unavailable
[*] --> ready
ready --> pending : Explicit action
pending --> invalid : Validation rejection
pending --> denied : Authority not accepted
pending --> conflict : Stale version / inconsistent request identity
pending --> incomplete : Accepted but effect incomplete
pending --> unknown : Completion cannot be established
pending --> confirmed : Owning result confirmed
pending --> unavailable : Definitive unavailable / failure
invalid --> ready : Correct permitted input
conflict --> ready : Review current state before new intent
denied --> ready : Re-establish permitted context if allowed
unavailable --> ready : Contract-defined safe recovery
incomplete --> confirmed : Existing operation completion observed
incomplete --> unavailable : Definitive failure observed
incomplete --> unknown : Evidence lost / unresolved
unknown --> confirmed : Same operation result resolved
unknown --> unavailable : Definitive outcome resolved
confirmed --> ready : Continue from recorded result
note bottom of unknown
No blind repeat or fabricated rollback.
Refresh/status lookup resolves the existing operation.
end note
legend bottom
  Conceptual UI outcomes, not a universal backend status enum.
  Loading/empty list states are separate from command completion.
  Every protected action rechecks current authority under its contract.
endlegend
@enduml
